sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant FBGW as Feedback Gateway
    participant FBCtrl as Feedback Controller
    participant FBSvc as Feedback Service
    participant RubricSvc as Rubric Service
    participant ScoreRepo as Score Repository
    participant RubricsRepo as Rubric Repository
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Redis as Redis Cache

    User->>Client: Submit feedback for session/turn
    Client->>FBGW: POST /feedback
    FBGW->>FBCtrl: handleFeedback()
    FBCtrl->>FBSvc: score(feedback, rubrics?)
    FBSvc->>RubricSvc: getRubric(config)
    RubricSvc->>RubricsRepo: fetch rubric
    RubricsRepo->>PG: SELECT rubrics
    RubricSvc-->>FBSvc: rubric

    FBSvc-->>FBCtrl: scores + rationale
    FBCtrl->>ScoreRepo: save(score)
    ScoreRepo->>PG: INSERT scores
    FBCtrl-->>FBGW: result
    FBSvc-->>Redis: cache aggregates
    FBSvc-->>MQ: publish feedback.ready
